# R8 keep rules for the release build. AGP combines every file in src/main/keepRules.
#
# Retrofit, OkHttp, Room, Hilt/Dagger and Coil ship their own consumer rules, so they need nothing here.

# Gson fills the PokeAPI DTOs by reflection, using their field names and generic types. R8 can't see
# that, so the DTOs must keep their names, fields and constructors.
-keepattributes Signature, InnerClasses, EnclosingMethod, RuntimeVisibleAnnotations
-keep class io.github.rodrigo4sousa.pokedex.data.remote.dto.** { *; }
